This fork:
- The Weapon Class filter added by this fork (also under org.starficz.refitfilters) is released under CC0-1.0, the same terms as the code it extends.
- The code under org.starficz.UIFramework is redistributed unmodified under LGPL-3.0-only. Full license texts are included as LICENSE-LGPL-3.0.txt and LICENSE-GPL-3.0.txt, and the complete source is in the src folder and at https://github.com/Sztarek/starsector-refit-filter-mod
- The mod icon (icon.ico) and the settings icon (graphics/icons/refit_filters_luna_icon.png) are Starficz's artwork and are not covered by the code licenses above.

AI disclosure:
The Weapon Class filter in this fork was vibe coded: Sztarek described the feature, an AI coding assistant (Claude, by Anthropic) wrote the code, and Sztarek tested it in-game. Starficz's original code was not written with AI.
